 MPC and FHE","target":"https://eprint.iacr.org/2016/687","line":36},{"title":"2015-113_1781533533016_0.pdf","target":"2015-113_1781533533016_0.pdf","line":37,"embedded":true},{"title":"Stream ciphers: A practical solution for efficient homomorphic-ciphertext compression","target":"https://eprint.iacr.org/2015/113.pdf","line":37},{"title":"2018-181_1781533304463_0.pdf","target":"2018-181_1781533304463_0.pdf","line":38,"embedded":true},{"title":"Rasta: A cipher with low ANDdepth and few ANDs per bit","target":"https://eprint.iacr.org/2018/181","line":38},{"title":"Dasta – Alternative Linear Layer for Rasta","target":"https://tosc.iacr.org/index.php/ToSC/article/view/8696","line":39},{"title":"ToSC2020_3_02_1781533367339_0.pdf","target":"ToSC2020_3_02_1781533367339_0.pdf","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"229_1781510048817_0.pdf","target":"229_1781510048817_0.pdf","line":40,"embedded":true},{"title":"Improved Filter Permutators for Efficient FHE: Better Instances and Implementations","target":"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-35423-7_4","line":40},{"title":"2020-1373_1781186867650_0.pdf","target":"2020-1373_1781186867650_0.pdf","line":41,"embedded":true},{"title":"Transciphering, Using FiLIP and TFHE for an Efficient Delegation of Computation","target":"https://eprint.iacr.org/2020/1373","line":41},{"title":"2020-masta_1781513204921_0.pdf","target":"2020-masta_1781513204921_0.pdf","line":42,"embedded":true},{"title":"Masta: An HE-Friendly Cipher Using Modular Arithmetic","target":"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/9240936","line":42},{"title":"2020-1335_1781186374031_0.pdf","target":"2020-1335_1781186374031_0.pdf","line":43,"embedded":true},{"title":"Transciphering Framework for Approximate Homomorphic Encryption (Full Version)","target":"https://eprint.iacr.org/2020/1335","line":43},{"title":"2021-731_1781190061193_0.pdf","target":"2021-731_1781190061193_0.pdf","line":44,"embedded":true},{"title":"Pasta: A Case for Hybrid Homomorphic